  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 213.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the criteria and procedures for waiving the requirements of RSA 21-G:37, I-IV, as contemplated by RSA 21-G:37, V.\n\nSource. #12386, eff 9-22-17",
